        "headline": "總統府駁回「作秀」說 法稱視導漢光屬責任義務",
        "summary": "總統府發言人郭雅慧表示，總統以三軍統帥身分視導漢光演習屬責任與義務，指稱「作秀」為臆測與扭曲，污名化國軍，強調國家元首參與重大演訓符合國際慣例，且演習採無劇本實戰化，無安排火力秀。",
        "headline_en": "Presidential Office rejects “show” claim, says Han Kuang inspection is duty",
        "summary_en": "The Presidential Office said President Lai Ching-te’s inspection of the Han Kuang exercise is a constitutional duty of the commander‑in‑chief, dismissing media allegations of a “show” as speculation that defames the military. Spokesperson Guo Ya‑hui noted that heads of state attending major drills is standard practice worldwide, and that since Han Kuang 40 the exercises have been unscripted and realistic, with the President’s visit arranged by the Ministry of National Defense according to the drill schedule. She called accusations of political motives unfair to personnel strengthening national defense.",
